PRINT ARG=cv FILE=no-gradients.colvar: exit code 0
BIASVALUE ARG=cv: exit code 1
forces were applied to this METATOMIC action, but no gradients of 'feature' with respect to positions are available. Either the model did not compute them -- metatomic only computes gradients of energies with automatic differentiation, so models used as biased CVs must compute them explicitly -- or PLUMED did not request them, which happens when the action was set up without derivatives and forces were applied to it afterwards
